      "one_paragraph": "The Vargari (Norse) are a expansionist clan confederation people seeded in tundra, taiga, grassland. They prize strength, freedom, glory, lean toward the military sphere, and field heavy_infantry, berserkers, marines. Outsiders are met as wary; their patrons touch sea, war, storms."
